### POST /projects/:projectId/tasks

- **Description**: Creates a new task for a specific project.

- **Authorization**: Required (Bearer Token). ADMIN only.

- **Request Body**:

    - `title` (string, required): Title of the task.
    - `description` (string, optional): Description of the task.
    - `timeAllotted` (number, optional): Allotted time for the task (in minutes).
    - `statusId` (string, required): ID of the task status.
    - `typeId` (string, required): ID of the task type.
    - `userId` (string, optional): ID of the user assigned to the task.
    - `file` (file, optional): File(s) attached to the task.

- **Response:**

    ```json
    {
        "task": {
            "id": 101,
            "title": "New Task",
            "description": "Task description",
            "timeAllotted": 120,
            "status": {
                "id": 1,
                "title": "Status title"
            },
            "type": {
                "id": 1,
                "title": "Type title"
            },
            "user": {
                "id": 10,
                "name": "User name",
                "email": "example@gmail.com",
                "role": "USER",
                "avatar": null
            },
            "files": [
                {
                    "id": 4,
                    "name": "new_file.jpg"
                }
            ]
        }
    }
    ```

---

### PUT /projects/:projectId/tasks/:taskId

- **Description**: Edits an existing task by ID for a specific project.

- **Authorization**: Required (Bearer Token).

- **Request Body**:

    - `title` (string, required): Updated task title.
    - `description` (string, optional): Updated task description.
    - `timeAllotted` (number, optional): Updated time allotted for the task (in minutes).
    - `timeTracked` (number, optional): Tracked time spent on the task (in minutes).
    - `statusId` (string, optional): Updated task status ID.
    - `typeId` (string, optional): Updated task type ID.
    - `userId` (string, optional): Updated user ID assigned to the task.
    - `file` (file, optional): File(s) attached to the task.

- **Response:**

    ```json
    {
        "task": {
            "id": 101,
            "title": "Updated Task",
            "description": "Updated task description",
            "timeAllotted": 150,
            "timeTracked": 60,
            "status": {
                "id": 1,
                "title": "Updated status"
            },
            "type": {
                "id": 2,
                "title": "Updated type"
            },
            "user": {
                "id": 10,
                "name": "User name",
                "email": "example@gmail.com",
                "role": "USER",
                "avatar": null
            },
            "files": [
                {
                    "id": 4,
                    "name": "updated_file.jpg"
                }
            ]
        }
    }
    ```

---

### DELETE /projects/:projectId/tasks/:taskId

- **Description**: Deletes a task by ID for a specific project.

- **Authorization**: Required (Bearer Token). ADMIN only.

- **Response:**

